+- **2026-10-12 (M6, reset buttons):** Reset-form actions retain the fully qualified name of an indirectly referenced field or group, and accept indirect strings containing field names. Targeted parser and button regressions pass on Linux for qualified field/group references, indirect string names, include/exclude selection, repeated leaf names, similarly prefixed groups, accepted empty ancestor names and save/reopen fidelity. Estimates unchanged.
